  "worked_solution": "To calculate $1÷\\frac{1}{8}$, we need to find how many times $\\frac{1}{8}$ fits into a whole. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129499/assets/5d97a785920930122759fa9eae688ac30244d54728720aff6f5c7dab21d05fc4.png)\n\n  \n\nWe can see that we get $1\\times 8=8$ parts in total. Therefore:\n\n$$\n1÷\\frac{1}{8}=8\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
